renamed n7_bratio() and the R headers replaced by src/n7_nmath.h. It is
R's C translation of ACM TOMS Algorithm 708 by Armido R. Didonato and
Alfred H. Morris, Jr. (ACM Transactions on Mathematical Software 18,
360-373, 1992), with changes by the R Core Team, and is distributed with R
under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or any later version.

